    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      430.63,
      286.44,
      490.14
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, of Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.04,
      491.59,
      228.36,
      501.68
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      502.42,
      286.42,
      619.99
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land called \u201cWelikanda Mukalana\u201d in total extent of about 0.0177 Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 145 in Final village plan No. 443, Suppliment No. 5, Sheet No. 7 dated 16.11.2016, surveyed and prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the village of Kiriwanapola, in Kiriwanapola Grama Niladhari Division of No. 983, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Alawwa in Kurunegala District, North Western Province and bounded as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      622.38,
      286.34,
      674.72
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 145 Name of the land: Welikanda Mukalan; Extent: 0.0177 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      676.15,
      286.44,
      709.28
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries : North : Lot No. 146; East : Lot No. 146; South : Lot No. 78; West : Lot No. 39.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      337.28,
      539.68,
      583.04
    ],
    "text": "Names and Addres of the claimants : 1. Mr. T. W. Senevirathna, No. 160/1, Wettewa Road, Kiriwanapola, Maharachchimulla. 2. Mrs. T. W. Chandrawathie, No. 160/1, Wettewa Road, Kiriwanapola, Maharachchimulla. 3. Mrs. T. W. Seelawathie Manike, No. 160/1, Wettewa Road, Kiriwanapola, Maharachchimulla. 4. Mr. T. W. Sanath Dayananda, No. 160/1, Wettewa Road, Kiriwanapola, Maharachchimulla. 5. Mrs. T. W. Kusumawathie, No. 160/1, Wettewa Road, Kiriwanapola, Maharachchimulla. 6. Mrs. T. W. Malani Hemalatha, No. 160/1, Wettewa Road, Kiriwanapola, Maharachchimulla. All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Alawwa Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office on 06th September 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 12th September 2017 the nature of their Interest in the land, the Particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
